  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8001.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the procedures and guidelines for the licensing of fuel gas fitters and fuel gas fitting business entities in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07; ss by #9542, eff 9-10-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8000.html"
